{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1329","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Dreamoon Likes Sequences"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Dreamoon likes sequences very much. So he created a problem about the sequence that you can't find in OEIS: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given two integers $$$d, m$$$, find the number of arrays $$$a$$$, satisfying the following constraints:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The length of $$$a$$$ is $$$n$$$, $$$n \\ge 1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1 \\le a_1 \\lt a_2 \\lt \\dots \\lt a_n \\le d$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Define an array $$$b$$$ of length $$$n$$$ as follows: $$$b_1 = a_1$$$, $$$\\forall i \\gt 1, b_i = b_{i - 1} \\oplus a_i$$$, where $$$\\oplus$$$ is the bitwise exclusive-or (xor). After constructing an array $$$b$$$, the constraint $$$b_1 \\lt b_2 \\lt \\dots \\lt b_{n - 1} \\lt b_n$$$ should hold. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since the number of possible arrays may be too large, you need to find the answer modulo $$$m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 100$$$) denoting the number of test cases in the input."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$t$$$ lines contains two integers $$$d, m$$$ ($$$1 \\leq d, m \\leq 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that $$$m$$$ is not necessary the prime!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print the number of arrays $$$a$$$, satisfying all given constrains, modulo $$$m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n1 1000000000\n2 999999999\n3 99999998\n4 9999997\n5 999996\n6 99995\n7 9994\n8 993\n9 92\n10 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n3\n5\n11\n17\n23\n29\n59\n89\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1329B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1329/problem/B"}